config BR2_PACKAGE_ROCKNIXDS_STORE
	bool "rocknixds-store"
	default y
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBDRM
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBCURL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBCURL_CURL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_CA_CERTIFICATES
	help
	  ROCKNIXDS's Store, on its own tile on the shelf: apps from GitHub releases (eReaderDS on the RG DS Plus for
	  now), installed in /data/store/apps and listed on the Apps shelf. The app draws straight to the panels (KMS,
	  Döda Kvarter's platform code); the package manager is Python, and fetches with curl.
